    "finalText": "Root is a vertical auto layout, so I'll pad the control with a wrapper-free approach: add left padding via a wrapper.\nI added a segmented control above the feature cards with three options: Compact, Comfortable and Spacious. Comfortable is selected, which matches the current card spacing.\n\nIt's a visual control only. Nothing is wired to it, so picking an option doesn't change the card padding or gaps yet. I didn't create separate Compact and Spacious spacing values for the cards either.\n\nI put it in a wrapper (`n_densitywrap1`) so it lines up with the 24px page margin.",
