    "finalText": "I added a \"Card density\" slider. It controls the padding inside each feature card, the gap between a card's title and body, and the gap between the cards. The default position of 24 matches your current spacing. Drag it left for tighter cards or right for roomier ones.\n\nI didn't run the lint check, since the slider doesn't change any nodes until you move it.",
